# Placeholder for local images

Replace royalty-free Unsplash URLs in `index.html` with your own band photos:

- Hero poster/video fallback
- Band member portraits
- Album artwork
- Gallery images
- Merchandise product shots
- Open Graph cover (`images/og-cover.jpg`)

Recommended image sizes:
- Hero: 1920×1080
- Members: 400×500
- Album: 600×600
- Gallery: varied (masonry)
- Merch: 400×400
- OG cover: 1200×630
